new <variable>

  Allow a new variable to be created and optionally dimensioned.

Examples:
  new i                 ;; create a new integer variable
  new %spd              ;; create a new float variable
  new $s[20]            ;; create a new string[20] variable
  new _x[5][2]          ;; create a 2-d array of cloc variables
  new #y                ;; create a new ploc variable

Type "help variables" for more information on the syntax of variables.

